  "releaseNotes": "2.1.1: Patch release. Consumes CoreSystem.Idempotency 2.1.1 which exposes Constants.HeaderNames as public.\n\t\t\t2.1.0: Multi-targeting release. The package now ships net8.0, net9.0 and net10.0 assets instead of net8.0 only, so a project on .NET 9 or .NET 10 gets an assembly compiled for its own target framework.\n\t\t\tDependency refresh. No code or API changes.\n\t\t\tDapper 2.1.79 to 2.1.89 and Npgsql 8.0.3 to 8.0.9, plus the refreshed transitive\n\t\t\tgraph (Microsoft.Extensions.* and OpenTelemetry.Extensions.Hosting 1.20.0).",
